Not worth carrying much food into gehennom, there's usually plenty to
eat.  Fooproofing things other than weapons is a waste unless you wind
up with a lot of extra scrolls.

> Nice to have on an ascension run are scrolls of gold detection and some
> method of confusion, so you can find the portals easier. Nothing is
> worse than spending a couple thousand turns on the plane of air dodging
> air elementals because you can't seem to find the stupid portal.

You can put on the Amulet and play hot/cold in a pinch, or use /secret
door detection.  There's no reason it should take anywhere near 1000
turns even w/ just the Amulet (unless you get horrific luck on water).

> One last note: you can never have enough methods of removing a curse in
